WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:04.326
Namaste. Is video mein jewellery ke do naye kaam dekhenge.

00:00:04.326 --> 00:00:10.591
Pehla, har karat ka alag rate, taaki 18 karat ka gehna 22 karat ke rate par na jude.

00:00:10.591 --> 00:00:17.304
Doosra, gold saving scheme, yaani mahine ki kisht, bonus, aur ant mein usi paise se gehna.

00:00:17.304 --> 00:00:19.691
Ye jewellery ka public demo hai.

00:00:20.039 --> 00:00:29.598
Today's rate ki screen. Ab 24, 22, 18 aur 14 karat ke alag rate hain. 24 karat ka rate daalte hain, unasi sau.

00:00:29.598 --> 00:00:38.983
Fill 22K, 18K and 14K from 24K dabane par baaki rate sone ki shuddhta ke hisaab se apne aap bhar jaate hain.

00:00:38.983 --> 00:00:43.850
Chahen to badal bhi sakte hain. Phir Save today's rates.

00:00:56.003 --> 00:01:02.614
Home screen par ab aaj ka 24 aur 22 karat ka rate dikhta hai, taaki counter par sabko pata rahe.

00:01:03.211 --> 00:01:06.042
Ab bill. Add jewellery item by weight.

00:01:06.042 --> 00:01:12.449
Karat chunte hain, 18K, aur naam aur wazan, paanch gram, making chaar sau rupaye gram.

00:01:12.449 --> 00:01:16.397
Dekhiye metal value 18 karat ke rate se lag raha hai.

00:01:16.397 --> 00:01:20.942
Saved design chunein to karat us design se apne aap aata hai.

00:01:21.314 --> 00:01:26.888
Add to bill aur Complete bill. Grahak purana sona bhi de raha hai.

00:01:26.888 --> 00:01:36.685
Exchange ke box mein rate pehle se aaj ka 24 karat ka bhara hai, kyunki purity pratishat se shuddh sona nikalta hai.

00:01:36.685 --> 00:01:39.725
Do gram, 91. 6 pratishat, aur Apply.

00:01:40.100 --> 00:01:44.029
Ab gold saving scheme. Menu mein Gold saving schemes.

00:01:44.029 --> 00:01:50.551
Start a scheme: grahak ka naam aur phone, mahine ki kisht paanch hazaar, gyaarah mahine.

00:01:50.551 --> 00:01:58.631
Bonus apne aap ek kisht ke barabar aata hai, badal bhi sakte hain. Pehli kisht abhi mili, cash. Start scheme.

00:01:59.015 --> 00:02:07.286
Scheme ka apna page aur number. Kitna jama hua, bonus, ant mein kitne ka gehna milega, aur agli kisht kab hai.

00:02:07.286 --> 00:02:13.226
Har mahine Take instalment se kisht lete hain, aur passbook mein jud jaati hai.

00:02:13.594 --> 00:02:19.033
Passbook ya reminder ka button grahak ko WhatsApp par poora hisaab bhejta hai.

00:02:19.033 --> 00:02:23.565
Aur kisht ka paisa usi din ke galle mein ginta hai, jis din mila.

00:02:23.931 --> 00:02:32.629
Scheme poori hone par bonus ke saath gehna milta hai. Grahak pehle lena chahe to jama paisa, bina bonus.

00:02:32.629 --> 00:02:41.662
Buy jewellery dabate hain. Bill khulta hai, grahak aur scheme ki rakam pehle se ghati hui. Gehna jodte hain.

00:02:42.035 --> 00:02:49.597
Complete bill. Scheme ka card dikh raha hai, minus das hazaar. Fully paid sirf baaki rakam maangta hai.

00:02:49.597 --> 00:02:50.845
Generate invoice.

00:02:50.845 --> 00:02:57.966
Invoice par scheme alag line mein hai, aur scheme ab Used ho gayi, dobara istemaal nahi ho sakti.

00:03:01.147 --> 00:03:12.539
To aaj humne dekha: har karat ka alag rate, 18 karat ka gehna sahi rate par, purana sona aaj ke rate par, aur gold saving scheme shuru se gehna lene tak.

00:03:12.539 --> 00:03:13.358
Dhanyavaad.
